i want to do this next story today  because it's important to do  but i want to be careful about the  message that i send to you and i have  something that i'm going to admit to you  which is that donald trump's mishandling  of coronavirus  has pushed me to be as close to a  prepper as i  as i have ever been now preppers are  those who believe  that there is a catastrophic disaster or  emergency  that is likely to occur in the future  and they make  active preparations for it typically  they stockpile  food sometimes they stockpile weapons  and ammunition they stockpile elements  of medical  as you may have come to know them and a  whole bunch of other supplies  and there's a political bent to prepping  so you've got just  general people who general preparedness  advocates who often are not  super politically entwined with the  movement but very often preppers  are small government conservatives  they're prepping because they have a  fundamental distrust of government  sometimes they even have conspiracy  theories about government  that lead them to prep sometimes you  have religiously motivated prepping  mormons for example often do long-term  food storage as a part of their  religion now i am not literally becoming  a prepper i'm not buying guns for  example i'm not buying a year of food or  anything like that  but there is no doubt that the degree to  which donald trump has been completely  untrustworthy and dishonest and  incompetent day in  and day out when it comes to the  coronavirus pandemic  has proven to me not that i need to have  a fundamental distrust of government  and therefore i should be prepping but  that the country is dumb enough to elect  people this poorly suited to manage a  crisis and i do need to be more prepared  it's healthy to have a skepticism of  government's ability to solve every  problem  and i've never trusted government in  certain areas  so for example i've never trusted  government to do foreign policy  correctly  right democrats and republicans we have  hundreds of years of history to  vindicate us on that look at the middle  east  look at latin america look at so many of  these other things  that was always an area where i was very  skeptical  of government part of it is the people  that we elect  to lead us i've never really trusted  government to do criminal justice  correctly look at the war on drugs look  at mass incarceration look at cannabis  look  all these different things but i have  mostly believed  that in a time of real crisis like a  pandemic i consider the coronavirus  pandemic to be one of those instances  i mostly believe that the government  would pull it together and  cross party lines and put ignorance and  politics  and partisanship aside and just take  care of things and yet as  60 000 americans have died 61 000 really  as we continue to find 15 20 25 000 new  cases of the virus every single day  as we clearly are yet not yet doing  nearly enough testing  donald trump has failed he's failed to  be proactive  every day he is going out in gaslighting  as thousands of people were dying on  monday  trump was publicly bragging about how  great everything he's done is  on tuesday as thousands of people were  continuing to die he went out and he did  a complete propaganda press conference  using people with cognitive disabilities  as props to brag about how he and ivanka  have saved the economy  as 30 million people now have lost their  jobs  tens of thousands of businesses have  been unable to get money from that  ppp program because huge corporations  took a ton of cash and the money ran out  so then i start to go to a dark place  our testing rate is  41st in the world and trump is bragging  we've done the most  tests we have the best tests it's total  gaslighting and they can't be trusted  so how does this get me to prepping  while i was thinking yesterday imagine  that we weren't dealing with a viral  pandemic for a second  imagine that the crisis was a bad actor  had poisoned the water supply in urban  areas  and the water was killing people  someone poisons the water supply people  start to die we figure out what it is  the water supply has been poisoned okay  people can't drink tap water anymore  until it gets sorted out but people need  water to live  trump is the type of guy who would have  a slow response  but would insist everything is fine he'd  say just run the tap  we're going to run the taps and  everything's going to be fine it'll  clear out  as people start to die not only from  drinking tainted water but also dying of  thirst  he would go on tv and he would say the  national guard has distributed tens of  millions of gallons  more than any government has ever done  who even heard of distributing 10  million gallons before  and people would be dying because 10  million gallons of water is nothing in a  country of 300 million  and 10 days would go by and there would  still be too little water much like  there are still too few tests and trump  would go on tv and say  hey here's 10 ceos who have developed  great water filtration devices  we've given them a ton of cash of course  huge cash cow for them  they're making money and we're going to  roll out a hundred thousand water  filtration kits to communities and we're  winning and people would be dying of  thirst  and when the hundred thousand filtration  kits show up six weeks later it's not  enough  now i am not someone who has distrusted  government  to effectively take care of some of  these basics  because i never imagined we'd have  someone so dishonest and so immoral in  the oval office but unfortunately  enough americans voted for it in 2016  and that's what we have  so i admit i've been buying more medical  supplies  i've been buying a water filtration  capability i bought some of those  water storage bricks waiting for them to  arrive  and i'll constantly keep you know 15  gallons of water for myself and another  15 gallons for my girlfriend  i've bought more non-perishable food  some supplies if electricity was out for  say  three days everything from you know  waterproof matches  to who knows what i've sort of gone down  down the rabbit hole so i'm sort of  cautiously not for the reasons that the  right wingers  who are preppers do it but cautiously  acquiring  stuff because i never imagined the  voters would do something  like put a donald trump in charge am i  crazy  if anybody else is feeling this way let  me know and i know that there will be  right wingers who say  david you you've taken the red pill you  are now one of us  no no no my my reasons for doing this  are not  small government conservatism or uh  sovereign citizen  ideology or any of that stuff it's wow  the american people might elect a [ __ ]  like this again  and he could or she could once again  fail us that's why i'm doing it  let me know your reaction let me know  what you think i'm on twitter  at d pacman

